{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-pipeline-design","title":"CI 流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/ci-pipeline-design","wordCount":690,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-流水线设计\">CI 流水线设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo CI 的目标是&quot;只运行必要的检查，同时保证变更不破坏任何依赖方&quot;，由三层手段叠加实现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>affected-only</td>\n<td>用 Git diff + 依赖图圈定检查范围</td>\n<td>减少 50–90% 构建范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵并行</td>\n<td>把不同包的检查分散到多个作业</td>\n<td>多包同时构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三层缓存</td>\n<td>远程构建缓存 + 依赖安装缓存 + artifacts</td>\n<td>跳过已缓存与重复构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心权衡在<strong>检查完整性 vs 执行成本</strong>：<code>...[origin/main...HEAD]</code> 的语义是&quot;自 origin/main 以来变更的包<strong>以及它们的下游依赖</strong>&quot;，这保证了即使只改 <code>utils</code>，依赖它的 <code>ui</code> 和 <code>web</code> 也会被检查。在此之上叠加缓存与并行使整体时间可控——这也解释了为什么这些优化手段是按&quot;减少范围 → 跳过计算 → 并行分摊&quot;的顺序递进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-ci-的核心挑战\">Monorepo CI 的核心挑战</h2><p>传统的 CI 配置为每个仓库运行固定的构建和测试流程。但在 Monorepo 中，每次 PR 可能只修改了一个包，运行全部包的构建和测试是巨大的浪费。Monorepo CI 设计的核心目标是：<strong>只运行必要的检查，同时保证变更不会破坏任何依赖方</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; DETECT[检测变更范围]&#10;    DETECT --&gt; AFFECTED[计算受影响的包]&#10;    AFFECTED --&gt; PARALLEL[并行执行检查]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; BUILD[Build affected]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; TEST[Test affected]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; LINT[Lint affected]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; TYPE[Typecheck affected]&#10;    BUILD &amp; TEST &amp; LINT &amp; TYPE --&gt; RESULT[汇总结果]\">flowchart TD\n    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; DETECT[检测变更范围]\n    DETECT --&gt; AFFECTED[计算受影响的包]\n    AFFECTED --&gt; PARALLEL[并行执行检查]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; BUILD[Build affected]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; TEST[Test affected]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; LINT[Lint affected]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; TYPE[Typecheck affected]\n    BUILD &amp; TEST &amp; LINT &amp; TYPE --&gt; RESULT[汇总结果]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"affected-only-ci-策略\">affected-only CI 策略</h2><p>使用 Turborepo 的 <code>--filter</code> 配合 Git diff 实现 affected-only CI：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main, develop]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  ci:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Typecheck&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run typecheck --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]&#10;&#10;      - name: Lint&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run lint --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]&#10;&#10;      - name: Test&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run test --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]&#10;&#10;      - name: Build&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">develop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run typecheck --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run lint --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run test --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>...[origin/main...HEAD]</code> 表示&quot;自 origin/main 以来发生变更的所有包，以及它们的下游依赖&quot;。这确保了即使你只修改了 <code>utils</code>，依赖 <code>utils</code> 的 <code>ui</code> 和 <code>web</code> 也会被检查。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵构建策略\">矩阵构建策略</h2><p>对于大型 Monorepo，可以将不同包的检查分散到多个 CI 作业中运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI Matrix&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  detect-changes:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    outputs:&#10;      matrix: ${{ steps.detect.outputs.matrix }}&#10;      has-changes: ${{ steps.detect.outputs.has-changes }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - id: detect&#10;        run: |&#10;          PACKAGES=$(pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD] --dry-run=json | jq -c &#39;{&quot;package&quot;: [.tasks[].package] | unique}&#39;)&#10;          HAS_CHANGES=$(echo $PACKAGES | jq &#39;.package | length &gt; 0&#39;)&#10;          echo &quot;matrix=$PACKAGES&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;          echo &quot;has-changes=$HAS_CHANGES&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;&#10;  check:&#10;    needs: detect-changes&#10;    if: needs.detect-changes.outputs.has-changes == &#39;true&#39;&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix: ${{ fromJson(needs.detect-changes.outputs.matrix) }}&#10;      fail-fast: false&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm turbo run build test lint typecheck --filter=${{ matrix.package }}...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI Matrix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  detect-changes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.detect.outputs.matrix }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      has-changes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.detect.outputs.has-changes }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">detect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          PACKAGES=$(pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD] --dry-run=json | jq -c '{\"package\": [.tasks[].package] | unique}')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          HAS_CHANGES=$(echo $PACKAGES | jq '.package | length > 0')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"matrix=$PACKAGES\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"has-changes=$HAS_CHANGES\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">detect-changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">needs.detect-changes.outputs.has-changes == 'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ fromJson(needs.detect-changes.outputs.matrix) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      fail-fast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E