><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run build test lint typecheck --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI 优化手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实施难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>affected-only</td>\n<td>减少 50-90% 构建范围</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程缓存</td>\n<td>跳过已缓存的任务</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵并行</td>\n<td>多包同时构建</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖缓存</td>\n<td>跳过 npm install</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Artifacts 共享</td>\n<td>避免重复构建</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖安装缓存\">依赖安装缓存</h2><p>CI 中缓存 <code>node_modules</code> 和 pnpm store 可以显著加速依赖安装：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    node-version: 20&#10;    cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;- name: Get pnpm store directory&#10;  shell: bash&#10;  run: echo &quot;STORE_PATH=$(pnpm store path --silent)&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_ENV&#10;&#10;- uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: ${{ env.STORE_PATH }}&#10;    key: pnpm-store-${{ hashFiles(&#39;**/pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}&#10;    restore-keys: pnpm-store-\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"